# MQ01 "Tutorial": the sewers and the way out. Baurus has told the player to leave through the sewers (Charactergen 88).
# The player works through the rat and goblin tunnels and reaches the sewer exit gate; its OnActivate (CGSewerExitScript)
# asks whether the player wants to revise the character, and "Finished - Exit Sewers" sets MQ01 stage 88, which starts
# the 5 s timer to stage 90 and then 100 (stopquest MQ01 and Charactergen).
# The tutorial hint stages are not driven here: they are message-only (MQ01Script) and depend on what the player
# picks up. Only the dungeon-progress ones with a fixed trigger are checked.

# The player walks the tunnels; moveto the door from the rats to the goblins stands in for that walk. MQ01Script sets
# stage 76 (hotkey tutorial) when the player is within 1000 of CGDoorFromRatsToGoblins.
case sewers_reach_goblin_door
run
player.moveto CGDoorFromRatsToGoblins
until 600 GetStageDone MQ01 76
end

# The sewer exit gate is a door with CGSewerExitScript and no EditorID: its placed ref's TES4 FormID (0004BED7) is used.
# Menu expected: the "Before exiting the sewers, you may revise your character." MessageBox; buttons 0 Edit Race,
# 1 Edit Birthsign, 2 Edit Class, 3 Finished - Exit Sewers.
case sewers_exit_gate
activate 0004BED7
wait 60
button 3
until 600 GetStageDone MQ01 88
end

# The gate takes the player outside. 5 s later MQ01 90 (the "red arrow on the compass" hint) sets 100, which stops
# MQ01 and Charactergen.
case sewers_tutorial_ends
until 900 GetStageDone MQ01 90
until 600 GetStageDone MQ01 100
expect GetQuestRunning Charactergen == 0
expect GetQuestRunning MQ01 == 0
until 600 player.GetInWorldspace Tamriel
expect player.GetItemCount AmuletofKings >= 1
end
